{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingfromalink"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A Verifier asks with an ","type":"text"},{"code":"openid4vp:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" link, as a QR code or a link on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its page. Register the ","type":"text"},{"code":"openid4vp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"links open the app, and hand the link to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)","isActive":true},{"text":". It fetches the Verifier’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"signed request, checks its certificate against","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and finds the credentials that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can answer it. A request from a Verifier the wallet doesn’t trust"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/untrustedVerifier","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" before anything is shown."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" it returns says:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"who is asking: "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/verifier-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"text":", its name, and its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Registration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when a registrar the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wallet trusts ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots"},{"type":"text","text":") registered it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with its purpose and the claims it’s registered to ask for;"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"what it asks for: ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/queries","isActive":true},{"text":", each with the held","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credentials that can answer it, and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/credentialSets","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request’s alternatives."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Present","level":3,"anchor":"Present"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Answers a request link: `confirm` shows the holder who is asking and","\/\/\/ what sharing would disclose, and returns whether they agree. Returns","\/\/\/ where to send the browser, when the Verifier asks.","func present(requestLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Presentation, [Presentation.Disclosure]) async -> Bool) async throws -> URL? {","    let presentation = try await wallet.startPresentation(request: requestLink)","    guard presentation.isAnswerable else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    let selection = try await presentation.defaultSelection()","    let disclosures = try await presentation.preview(selection: selection)","    guard await confirm(presentation, disclosures) else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks for it.","    return try await presentation.respond(selection: selection).redirectURI","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/defaultSelection()","isActive":true},{"text":" picks the first credential that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"answers each query, and the first answerable option of each credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"set. To let the holder choose, build a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Selection","isActive":true},{"text":" from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each query’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/credentials","isActive":true},{"text":" instead: a query that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes one credential gets exactly one. The wallet presents exactly the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"selection, after checking it answers the request","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":